<!--
  Rakatan stasis chambers (design/RimStarWars/cold_storage_line_2026-10-26.md §4.2 layer 2,
  COLD_STORAGE_STASIS_BUILD_RAKATAN_CHAMBERS): the casket (1x2) and the vault (3x3), skins of Cold Storage's ancient
  stasis locker. They sit in Cuisine until a layer-2 Rakatan mod exists, then move there. Every def carries
  MayRequire="mandrake.rm.coldstorage": without the engine the whole line stays out.

  One def per Wrecked Machines grade (line RSW_RakatanStasisCasket / RSW_RakatanStasisVault, replaceTags). Stasis
  strength follows the grade (owner ruling 2026-10-26): Kludged 0.2, Refurbished 0.75, Original full; rot on held goods
  is 1 - strength. Power is 400 W / strength (Kludged 2000 W, Refurbished 533 W, Original 400 W; scalePowerByStrength).
  Capacity per cell follows the grade: Kludged 1, Refurbished 3, Original 4 (vault full = 36 stacks; the design's 30
  cannot divide over 9 cells). A weak field flickers: an hour of normal spoiling and a spark mote each time.

  How you get one ("what you unlock through the ship or loot from their ancient tech dungeons", owner 2026-10-26):
  - Ship: RSW_RakatanStasis research is a ShipRelated project after Wrecked Machines' power cell restoration (the
    ship-subsystem restoration line) and cryo storage. It lets you BUILD the Refurbished grade from ancient components.
  - Loot: StructureInjectionsRUT's Frozen Rakata vault (RUT_VaultType3_FrozenRakata) places Wrecked and Kludged
    chambers. Studying a wreck with Research Reinvented's Analyse (Defs below) is the fast road to the research.
  - Restoration: with Wrecked Machines, Patches/RSW_RakatanStasisLadder.xml lets you build Kludged over Wrecked and
    Original over a lower grade (Original hidden unless Wrecked Machines' "allow full restoration" is on).

  INTERIM ART: the casket draws vanilla's ancient cryptosleep pod, the vault the ancient security crate at 3x3, until
  their own art lands (art queue). No geometric placeholder ships.
-->
<Defs>

  <ResearchProjectDef MayRequire="mandrake.rm.coldstorage">
    <defName>RSW_RakatanStasis</defName>
    <label>Rakatan stasis</label>
    <description>The Rakata kept their war stores in fields that stop time for what they hold. Restore enough of a stasis chamber's emitters to build refurbished chambers from ancient components.\n\nStudying a wrecked Rakatan chamber (Research Reinvented's Analyse) is the fast route.</description>
    <baseCost>3000</baseCost>
    <techLevel>Spacer</techLevel>
    <tags>
      <li>ShipRelated</li>
    </tags>
    <prerequisites>
      <li>RSW_CryoStorage</li>
      <li MayRequire="mandrake.rm.wreckedmachines">RM_WM_PowerCellRestoration</li>
    </prerequisites>
    <researchViewX>17.00</researchViewX>
    <researchViewY>6.30</researchViewY>
  </ResearchProjectDef>

