    <description>A Rakatan stasis casket from the frozen vaults of Belsavis: a coffin-sized chamber that wraps what it holds in a field older than the Republic. Its field went dark long ago, its seals are cracked and whatever it held is dust. The field emitters are not ruined past saving.\n\nStudy it to learn Rakatan stasis, or build a better grade over it.</description>
